Shipping a binary
-----------------

A pdfskim binary embeds code from the vendored tree. Ship this NOTICE with it,
together with LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE and the licence files under
_vendor/pdfcraft: NOTICE, LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE, LICENSES.toml and the
LICENSE* files of the vendored crates.
